# Run Without Stops — project conventions

- Single Next.js app: UI in `src/app`, backend in `src/app/api`.
- Package manager is **pnpm** only (never npm/yarn lockfiles).
- Use `@/` imports. Prefer small focused modules over large files.
- Validate env via `src/env.ts` (`@t3-oss/env-nextjs` + Zod). Never read raw `process.env` in feature code.
- Validate API request/response bodies with Zod schemas under `src/lib/schemas`.
- Prefer Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed.
- Run `pnpm check` before considering work done (typecheck + lint + test + build).
- Do not add shadcn, monorepos, or extra UI kits unless explicitly requested.
